{
  "_readme": [
    "Hand-curated map: our exercise-catalog slug -> the free-exercise-db exercise NAME",
    "(yuhonas/free-exercise-db, Unlicense/public domain). Consumed by",
    "scripts/import-exercise-images.mjs, which resolves the name to the dataset id and",
    "downloads that exercise's two frames into frontend/public/exercises/{slug}-a|b.jpg.",
    "",
    "EVERY ENTRY IS HAND-VERIFIED. Do NOT fuzzy-match this file: on our catalog a token-overlap",
    "matcher confidently paired Pull-Up -> Scapular Pull-Up, Cable Fly -> Cable Rear Delt Fly and",
    "Barbell Row -> Upright Barbell Row. A wrong image teaches the wrong movement, which is worse",
    "than no image — so a slug with no faithful counterpart is simply absent from this map and",
    "renders imageless (a specced state, not a gap to paper over).",
    "",
    "A few names are shared by two slugs on purpose (e.g. lateral-raise and db-lateral-raise-21s",
    "are the same movement, one with a rep scheme) — that is honest reuse, not a mistake."
  ],

